      "The Church of Barran Resonance Dodger is the worldwide foundation constituted under the philosophical, spiritual, and ethical framework of this charter. It is not a church in the narrow sectarian sense. It is a church in the ancient sense of the word — an assembly, a gathering, a community of people committed to a common truth. Its membership is open to every human being who affirms its foundational principles: truth, peace, love, prosperity, equality, non-violence, and the inherent dignity of every person. Its liturgy is evidence. Its scripture is documentation. Its practice is advocacy. And its God — whatever name any member gives to the transcendent foundation of their moral life — is the same God that all prophetic traditions have recognised in the defence of the vulnerable against the powerful.",
