      "This is the blunt statement that the evidence compels: humanity, under the current paradigm, will not survive. This is not prophecy in the mystical sense. It is the conclusion of the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, the IPBES Global Assessment, the Planetary Boundaries research programme, and every major international scientific body that has examined the trajectory of the current civilisational operating system. End-stage capitalism, combined with end-stage Anthropocene, produces a vector that intersects, within the current century, with collapse. Not metaphorical collapse. Actual, physical, systems-level collapse of the ecological, social, and economic foundations of complex human civilisation.",
